==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|сткля́нка<q:obsolete>}}

===Etymology===
From the obsolete form {{m|ru|сткля́нка}}, from {{inh|ru|orv|стьклянъ}}; cognate with {{m|ru|стекло́|t=glass (material)}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|скля́нка}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|скля́нка|*|dim=скля́ночка}}

# {{C|ru|Containers|Food and drink containers}} [[vial]], [[flask]], [[bottle]], [[glass]] {{gl|any kind of small glass vessel}}
#: {{syn|ru|скля́ница}}
# {{lb|ru|nautical}} [[bell]], [[half]] an [[hour]]
#: {{uxi|ru|пробило [[шесть]] '''скля́нок'''|six bells went}}
# {{lb|ru|nautical|obsolete|in the plural}} [[watch glass]], [[hourglass]]

